{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0074-search-a-2d-matrix","title":"LeetCode 74 搜索二维矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0074-search-a-2d-matrix","wordCount":848,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-74-搜索二维矩阵\">LeetCode 74 搜索二维矩阵</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个满足下述两条属性的 m × n 整数矩阵：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每行中的整数从左到右按非递减顺序排列</li>\n<li>每行的第一个整数大于前一行的最后一个整数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>给你一个整数 <code>target</code>，如果 <code>target</code> 在矩阵中，返回 <code>true</code>；否则返回 <code>false</code>。</p>\n<p>你必须设计一个时间复杂度为 O(log(m * n)) 的算法。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>m == matrix.length</li>\n<li>n == matrix[i].length</li>\n<li>1 ≤ m, n ≤ 100</li>\n<li>-10⁴ ≤ matrix[i][j], target ≤ 10⁴</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：matrix = [[1,3,5,7],[10,11,16,20],[23,30,34,60]], target = 3输出：true</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：matrix = [[1,3,5,7],[10,11,16,20],[23,30,34,60]], target = 13输出：false</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的矩阵具有一个非常重要的性质：如果将每一行首尾相接拼成一维数组，它就是一个严格递增的有序数组。因此可以将二维矩阵看作一维有序数组来使用标准二分搜索。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力解法</strong>：逐个遍历矩阵所有元素，时间复杂度 O(m × n)。</p>\n<p><strong>逐行二分</strong>：先确定 target 可能在哪一行（比较每行首尾元素），再在该行内二分，时间复杂度 O(m + log n)。</p>\n<p><strong>全局二分（最优解）</strong>：将矩阵视为长度为 m × n 的一维数组，用索引映射公式 <code>row = Math.floor(idx / n)</code> 和 <code>col = idx % n</code> 将一维索引转换为二维坐标，直接做标准二分搜索。</p>\n<p>索引映射的原理非常直观：对于一个 m × n 的矩阵，第 <code>idx</code> 个元素位于第 <code>Math.floor(idx / n)</code> 行、第 <code>idx % n</code> 列。这是因为每行有 <code>n</code> 个元素，所以行号是整除结果，列号是余数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力遍历</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>逐元素比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐行二分</td>\n<td>O(m + log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>先定行再二分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局二分</td>\n<td>O(log(m × n))</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>矩阵展平为一维数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function searchMatrix(matrix: number[][], target: number): boolean {&#10;  const m = matrix.length;&#10;  const n = matrix[0].length;&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = m * n - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;    const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;    const row = Math.floor(mid / n);&#10;    const col = mid % n;&#10;    const value = matrix[row][col];&#10;&#10;    if (value === target) {&#10;      return true;&#10;    } else if (value &lt; target) {&#10;      left = mid + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      right = mid - 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchMatrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix[row][col];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<p>将整个 m × n 矩阵看作一个长度为 <code>m * n</code> 的虚拟一维数组。搜索范围从索引 0 到 <code>m * n - 1</code>。每次取中间索引 <code>mid</code>，通过除法和取模运算将其映射回矩阵的行列坐标，获取对应值后与 <code>target</code> 比较，标准二分缩小范围。</p>\n<p>这种方法的优雅之处在于完全复用了一维二分搜索的逻辑，唯一新增的操作就是索引到坐标的映射，代码简洁且不易出错。</p>\n<p><strong>逐行二分的替代实现：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function searchMatrixTwoStep(matrix: number[][], target: number): boolean {&#10;  const m = matrix.length;&#10;  const n = matrix[0].length;&#10;&#10;  let top = 0;&#10;  let bottom = m - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (top &lt;= bottom) {&#10;    const midRow = top + Math.floor((bottom - top) / 2);&#10;    if (matrix[midRow][n - 1] &lt; target) {&#10;      top = midRow + 1;&#10;    } else if (matrix[midRow][0] &gt; target) {&#10;      bottom = midRow - 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      let left = 0;&#10;      let right = n - 1;&#10;      while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;        const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;        if (matrix[midRow][mid] === target) return true;&#10;        else if (matrix[midRow][mid] &lt; target) left = mid + 1;&#10;        else right = mid - 1;&#10;      }&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchMatrixTwoStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matrix[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"c